<title>HONG KONG: Moody's rates Asia Pulp subsidaries.</title>
<headline>Moody's rates Asia Pulp subsidaries.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday it assigned ratings to several debt issues of subsidiaries of Indonesia's Asia Pulp &amp; Paper Co Ltd (APP) and confirmed the existing ratings of several operating subsidiaries of the company.</p>
</text>
